          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: CANET-EN-ROUSSILLON (66) 11.08.2009 T1 CANET-EN-ROUSSILLON (66) 11.08.2009 T2",
          "text_sha256": "2398764dcb0965595d90522e0d9abff4254a7209eb6108d9a1713ba45563702b"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
